    //   IfloatShape3       every shape: distance from a point
    //   IfloatEstimable3   + can be estimated from a small sample      -> RANSAC
    //   IfloatWeighted3    + can be re-estimated from per-point weights -> IRLS
    //   IfloatParametric3  + packs into a parameter vector              -> NLS
    //
